  "description": "Superpowers are being born little by little all over the world.  \n In an age where people are watched over because they have special powers, they are born with psychic powers that can read rational minds.\n\n'Sungha' is afraid of thunder because of his special ability, at a new high school, he meets Saebyeol, whom he broke up with when he was in elementary school... .\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[BookCube](https://www.bookcube.com/toon/detail.asp?webtoon_num=180040), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/51511616), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/120042014), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=3521908), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/comic/ep_list/cjsendth_f), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/thundersound), [Peanutoon](https://www.peanutoon.com/ko/comic/detail/4121)",
